WEBVTT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:11.860
MOBILE SUIT
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY</b>

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:29.630
En route to Kasarelia, with Europe lying before them,

00:01:29.660 --> 00:01:32.030
Üso and the others aboard the White Ark...

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:34.900
...were attacked by a lone Motorad ship.

00:01:34.930 --> 00:01:37.500
It was Duker Iq and Renda's combat unit,

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:39.800
who used their Einerads on the water.

00:01:40.430 --> 00:01:45.030
While Üso and the others succeeded in driving them away,

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:48.760
they prepared for the next battle.

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:51.300
DYEING THE NORTH SEA IN FLAMES

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:54.700
"Dyeing the North Sea in Flames".
DYEING THE NORTH SEA IN FLAMES

00:02:13.430 --> 00:02:17.360
From the outside, the repaired section looks about done.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:19.730
I told you, those parts aren't for the Domuttlia!

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:21.730
Move them over there!

00:02:22.930 --> 00:02:24.930
I guess that does it.

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:30.430
A one room would be nice.

00:02:30.530 --> 00:02:31.460
Lieutenant Renda?

00:02:32.230 --> 00:02:33.200
Are we moving out?

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:35.960
We'll be ready to launch in a few minutes.

00:02:36.030 --> 00:02:36.900
Good work.

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:39.230
Oh, Lt. Commander.

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:42.100
What are you drawing? Let me see, Renda.

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:43.560
But...

00:02:46.230 --> 00:02:47.630
Oh, great...

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:49.730
Be careful on your sortie.

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:50.600
Yes, sir.

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:53.030
So, what's with the log cabin?

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:56.660
I tried to make it octagonal. Does it not look like it?

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:59.230
Is that you standing next to it?

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:00.660
Yes, sir.

00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:03.030
You plan to build it on Earth?

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:03.760
Yes, sir.

00:03:04.130 --> 00:03:07.400
I've always wanted to live in a house like that.

00:03:07.860 --> 00:03:10.660
Is there a room for me in here?

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:13.730
What? Sir, please don't tease me.

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:16.260
It's boring to live alone.

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:19.330
I'm serious, Renda.

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:22.860
I never thought it that far through, sir.

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:26.130
When the war is over, let's live together.

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:32.000
My mother was against me being a biker.

00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:36.200
She gave this to me as a memento when I entered officer's training school.

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:38.460
I can't accept something so precious!

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:41.960
I want to give it to you. Turn around.

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:43.430
Yes, sir.

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:52.630
Thank you very much.

00:03:52.860 --> 00:03:54.800
Launch preparations are complete!

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:56.630
Gotcha! On my way!

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:58.900
Well then, Lt. Commander. I'm off.

00:03:58.930 --> 00:04:00.560
Right. Go to it.

00:04:09.230 --> 00:04:11.430
Are you not feeling well, Miss Marbet?

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:13.330
Why do you ask?

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:17.360
Your unit's moving differently than usual, Miss Marbet.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:20.260
You're able to notice something that subtle?

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:23.260
If you're sick, just leave the recon to us.

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:25.000
Head back to the White Ark.

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:26.560
I'll take you up on that.

00:04:32.360 --> 00:04:34.560
Is Miss Marbet all right?

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:38.900
Women get a little sick once a month.

00:04:39.430 --> 00:04:39.700
Ow!

00:04:41.060 --> 00:04:42.260
What's wrong, Odelo?

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:43.360
N-Nothing!

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:47.800
N-No point in patrolling together. Let's split up!

00:04:48.030 --> 00:04:51.360
Roger. Contact me in five minutes.

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:55.460
Gimme a break! Did I say something wrong?

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:57.560
You were making fun of women!

00:04:58.060 --> 00:04:59.900
I didn't mean to.

00:04:59.930 --> 00:05:00.800
Really?

00:05:00.830 --> 00:05:04.330
I wouldn't let you ride in my mobile suit if I wanted to do that!

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:17.230
You know Spacenoids like us aren't used to the ocean yet!

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:20.660
Are you teasing me, landing in a stinky place like this?!

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:21.860
No!

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:25.130
We need to check out places like this!

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:27.230
That didn't hurt, did it?

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:28.660
Yes, it hurt!

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:31.200
This'll make you feel better.

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:35.200
Have a cup before we go out again. It'll warm you up.

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:38.200
So, what did you want to talk to me about privately?

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:40.300
Um... Well...

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:43.930
That's what you get for rushing.

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:45.400
This is for you.

00:05:45.430 --> 00:05:46.730
Odelo, look!

00:05:56.300 --> 00:06:01.660
Please, share with me your dream of making Earth a biker's paradise.

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:06.760
Lieutenant, I've sighted a possible mobile suit.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:07.600
What?

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:12.930
Didn't that thing run away?!

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:22.600
He can't be alone! His friends are coming!

00:06:25.930 --> 00:06:26.830
We're surrounded!

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:29.260
You told me this would be a safe recon mission!

00:06:29.300 --> 00:06:32.000
I swear, I won't let you get killed! Now, take this!

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:34.000
A whale necklace?

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:35.000
For luck!

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:35.830
This thing?

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:37.460
Don't talk! You'll bite your tongue!

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:41.360
Don't let him get behind me! I'm going out!

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:42.130
Right!

00:06:44.900 --> 00:06:46.630
I missed! What?!

00:06:50.230 --> 00:06:52.000
This is for Cicely!

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:58.030
I can't let you kill Elisha!

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:10.600
There was still gas in that tanker?

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:12.660
Lieutenant Renda, the white one's here!

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:14.630
I told you their main force was here!

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:15.430
Yes, ma'am!

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:17.230
Domuttlia, transforming!

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:41.130
Thanks to them getting caught in that explosion,

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:44.600
we were able to sneak into this tanker. That was lucky.

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:47.130
The suit isn't badly damaged, either.

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:49.460
It's strange. I can smell oil.

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:51.660
Really? You smell it?

00:07:52.260 --> 00:07:54.030
If we can smell oil in here,

00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:56.930
wouldn't that mean there's a breach in the suit somewhere?

00:07:57.030 --> 00:07:59.230
I don't think there is,

00:07:59.530 --> 00:08:01.630
but what if there's still gas in this tank?

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:08.330
Then even the smallest spark could set off a huge explosion!

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:11.700
Hey, Odelo, can't we get out of here?

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:16.400
They're still outside. We'll get out, soon.

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:19.500
We won't die. You've got that good luck charm.

00:08:19.530 --> 00:08:21.100
Make a wish on it.

00:08:21.160 --> 00:08:23.130
Y... Yeah.

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:31.100
What's wrong? Is the smell getting to you?

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:33.200
I'm catching a cold.

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:38.430
Since arriving on Earth, we've been parched one minute and soaked the next.

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:41.630
Even my lips are all dried and chapped.

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:44.900
Your lips? Wanna wet them?

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:46.200
Not now.

00:08:47.030 --> 00:08:48.000
R-Right...

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:54.000
No response from Odelo's unit.

00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:56.400
Nothing to hear. Nothing. Nothing.

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:06.630
Üso, we can't be certain that they got Odelo!

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:10.130
Miss Elisha was riding in Odelo's Gun Blaster, too!

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:11.530
What?! Why?!

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:14.030
Because Odelo wanted to go on a date.

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:15.360
Dodge!

00:09:16.930 --> 00:09:19.400
Split up! I'll take the white one!

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:20.300
Roger!

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:27.260
The tires have saws?!

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:32.860
These damn things!

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:49.160
Should I give them some missile cover, Mr. Václav?

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:50.860
Not yet, Warren!

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:53.430
My sister was in Odelo's suit!

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:56.160
They might be hiding in the sea.

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:58.800
Miss Marbet, should you be here?

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:00.960
Václav, I'm going out in V1!

00:10:01.400 --> 00:10:03.260
You must still feel sick.

00:10:03.430 --> 00:10:05.230
I can't just wait here!

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:07.260
Warren, cover me!

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:09.930
Should she be going?

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:12.100
There, there.

00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:17.230
What is that, Dad?

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:19.560
It lets me fire the missiles from here.

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:20.560
Hurry!

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:25.630
We'll use the White Ark's shield!

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:27.200
The White Ark's shield?

00:10:34.330 --> 00:10:35.960
You're not going any further!

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:37.060
Lieutenant Renda!

00:10:37.230 --> 00:10:40.460
The white one's team has shown up! Lure them in!

00:10:42.960 --> 00:10:44.900
Üso, you're in too deep!

00:10:45.060 --> 00:10:49.030
If we don't take out these treaty-breakers, they'll attack again!

00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:51.460
Finding Elisha and Odelo comes first!

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:52.860
Yes, but...

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:55.030
For now, we'll follow Üso!

00:10:55.060 --> 00:10:56.160
But, sir!

00:11:01.030 --> 00:11:03.260
What?! Where'd they go, Haro?!

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:04.630
H-Haro...

00:11:11.860 --> 00:11:12.760
More!

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:13.700
An ambush!

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:41.000
Miss Marbet!

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:42.130
Meet the enemy!

00:11:42.160 --> 00:11:42.960
Right!

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:46.400
Firing missiles!

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:47.300
Right!

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:52.930
Keep the white one to our rear away from us!

00:11:53.030 --> 00:11:55.960
We'll capture them in the Spider Net! Fire!

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:02.960
A glowing net?!

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:04.230
Cut it with the shield!

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:13.160
Oh, no! Oh, no!

00:12:13.530 --> 00:12:16.660
We screwed up by shutting down the shield to fire the missiles!

00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:18.160
Stay in your seats!

00:12:18.260 --> 00:12:18.830
What?!

00:12:18.860 --> 00:12:20.300
Hang in there!

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:25.500
What happened to the White Ark?! Miss Marbet!

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:29.500
The White Ark can't move!

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:35.230
White Ark! Danger! Danger!

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:38.830
I know! They've modified their beam cannon into a shield!

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:46.600
Attack from the surface while we keep the white one pinned down!

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:48.930
Bikers don't belong in the sky!

00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:55.760
Mr. Václav, our memory's destroyed!

00:12:55.930 --> 00:12:57.060
Don't change it yet!

00:12:57.100 --> 00:12:57.900
Huh?

00:12:58.160 --> 00:13:00.130
This jamming voltage is decreasing.

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:03.230
Once it's out, swap out the memory and chips!

00:13:05.560 --> 00:13:07.530
You won't escape!

00:13:08.130 --> 00:13:11.330
Once you cut off the Spider Net I came up with,

00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:13.760
you won't be able to move right away!

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:18.530
Renda! I've stopped them for you!

00:13:21.100 --> 00:13:24.100
Lt. Commander Iq, the white ship's been stopped.

00:13:24.430 --> 00:13:26.800
Now we just need to hit the white suit!

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:34.160
I went in too deep,

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:37.030
and now everyone's fallen into the enemy's trap!

00:13:42.560 --> 00:13:44.560
You can't hide in a bunch of spray!

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:50.730
Don't take off just for that!

00:13:50.900 --> 00:13:52.730
The only one flying should be Renda!

00:14:03.960 --> 00:14:05.830
Where are they?! Where are they coming from?!

00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:08.330
Let me be the only target now!

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:11.030
Situation, unclear!

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:12.060
Üso!

00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:15.430
Václav, can you move, yet?

00:14:15.860 --> 00:14:18.600
V2 can't keep that up much longer!

00:14:18.760 --> 00:14:20.060
The next attack's coming.

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:23.030
Tomáš, give Üso some cover!

00:14:23.230 --> 00:14:24.160
Y-Yes, sir!

00:14:28.160 --> 00:14:30.030
Üso's splitting the sea?

00:14:30.730 --> 00:14:33.730
Quiet! Everyone's nervous enough as it is!

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:38.600
Don't underestimate me, you white bastard!

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:51.760
They got us!

00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:52.930
According to plan!

00:15:00.200 --> 00:15:01.800
Here comes the enemy ship!

00:15:06.730 --> 00:15:10.200
I'll use you as bait to lure out the Reineforce!

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:14.300
Cease your impertinence!

00:15:19.030 --> 00:15:20.130
Quiet!

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:21.860
Karl, hang in there, please!

00:15:27.760 --> 00:15:29.860
The white one's sending out a distress signal!

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:31.300
Excellent! Just what we want!

00:15:31.560 --> 00:15:35.160
That should bring the League Militaire's main ship running!

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:47.230
Dammit, one careless shot could blow it up!

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:52.700
It's no use!

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:56.900
The White Ark's still immobilized and this battlefield's shrinking!

00:15:57.230 --> 00:16:01.500
So, I need to shoot that thing without blowing it up, but I can't!

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:04.760
You've stopped, white one?

00:16:05.430 --> 00:16:06.200
What?!

00:16:06.460 --> 00:16:07.360
Dammit!

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:21.060
Looks like they've noticed us.

00:16:21.530 --> 00:16:23.300
If we can lure them to us...

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:28.230
You like that?

00:16:28.260 --> 00:16:30.600
You think I wouldn't notice a wreck drifting at that speed?!

00:16:34.700 --> 00:16:35.560
What?!

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:37.030
There's my opening!

00:16:39.730 --> 00:16:41.060
He got my hatch!

00:16:43.960 --> 00:16:47.060
If I shoot it, it'll set off a nuclear blast bigger than that tanker!

00:16:47.100 --> 00:16:48.900
Who is that?! Is that you, Odelo?!

00:16:57.300 --> 00:17:00.700
Tomáš! Marbet! Are you all right? Where's the White Ark?!

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:03.060
Looks like they're still okay, but...

00:17:03.230 --> 00:17:04.900
Look at what's happened to everyone.

00:17:04.930 --> 00:17:07.200
I'm taking responsibility for causing this mess!

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:08.600
There they are!

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:15.300
Why are they all fighting like that?!

00:17:15.660 --> 00:17:17.530
Because they're trying to win while flying...

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:20.860
...as little as possible and not causing any explosions, right?

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:23.100
Because of that ceasefire agreement?

00:17:23.660 --> 00:17:26.230
Because nuclear blasts will just contaminate the Earth even more.

00:17:26.260 --> 00:17:27.330
Besides that...

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:30.630
These enemies since yesterday are different from the usual BESPA!

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:32.460
Different from the usual BESPA?

00:17:33.460 --> 00:17:34.300
They're flying!

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:41.660
White suit, I may not want to contaminate the place I want to live in, but...

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:42.930
...DIE!!!

00:17:43.130 --> 00:17:44.160
Bloodlust!

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:50.260
What?! A beam from behind?!

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:55.530
Odelo's landing!

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:58.230
Miss Elisha, hurry!

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:00.600
H-Hold on. Here!

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:03.300
You need this good luck charm, right?

00:18:03.400 --> 00:18:05.030
You keep it.

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:07.500
Give me another charm in its place.

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:08.230
Huh?

00:18:08.260 --> 00:18:09.030
Please!

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:12.700
You make it back.

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:14.600
Do that, and you'll get more.

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:16.660
You can count on it!

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:17.900
I mean it.

00:18:18.560 --> 00:18:19.460
Thanks.

00:18:29.900 --> 00:18:32.760
The Twinrads can't get near the white ones.

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:34.600
Lieutenant Renda Paloma!

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:36.460
We're giving chase!

00:18:36.560 --> 00:18:37.430
Sorry.

00:18:37.530 --> 00:18:38.430
Are you injured?

00:18:38.900 --> 00:18:40.030
Nothing serious.

00:18:41.060 --> 00:18:42.660
Take off, Lt. Commander Iq!

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:45.260
They're coming in head on?! Are they insane?!

00:18:45.530 --> 00:18:48.130
Odelo! Stop attacking for no reason!

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:50.000
The enemy's already retreating!

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:57.930
You've got some nerve, breaking the ceasefire!

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:01.700
You're hurt?

00:19:01.730 --> 00:19:03.030
A little bruised.

00:19:03.060 --> 00:19:04.230
Raise barrier!

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:08.530
I knew you'd do that!

00:19:11.600 --> 00:19:13.400
Odelo, it's over!

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:14.660
Stay out of this!

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:31.930
Miss Marbet, Tomáš, do you read me?

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:34.130
The enemy ship has been immobilized.

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:36.200
I did it?

00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:40.060
Are Miss Marbet and the others okay?

00:19:40.230 --> 00:19:44.060
The tire suits have retreated. You aren't injured, right?

00:19:44.100 --> 00:19:47.230
R-Right. Odelo and Üso, both fine.

00:19:58.730 --> 00:20:03.000
Did I get carried away, and attack when I didn't need to?

00:20:10.260 --> 00:20:11.300
Still...

00:20:11.830 --> 00:20:14.100
You guys came to attack us.

00:20:26.060 --> 00:20:27.030
A bike?

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:31.530
What?

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:33.700
That was a motorcycle, wasn't it?

00:20:33.730 --> 00:20:34.860
Yeah.

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:51.060
On the journey tabi no yukue no

00:20:53.300 --> 00:20:58.430
In the flickering darkness yurameku yami ni

00:20:58.530 --> 00:21:04.660
Let's take the path where kibou wo kizamu

00:21:05.560 --> 00:21:13.030
People's painful feelings hito no setsunai omoi wo

00:21:14.130 --> 00:21:20.760
Engraved with hope hinageshi no iro de

00:21:20.760 --> 00:21:22.260
Renda, are you all right?!

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:26.830
Are woven together with tsumugiawase

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:28.030
Renda,

00:21:28.060 --> 00:21:31.260
The colors of poppies michi ni shiyou
are you all right?!

00:21:31.260 --> 00:21:33.230
This special battleship will...
The colors of poppies michi ni shiyou

00:21:33.230 --> 00:21:34.730
...so fill the enemy with fear

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:34.760
The colors of poppies michi ni shiyou

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:37.330
that Operation Earth Clean will be...

00:23:29.830 --> 00:23:32.230
Even after arriving back in Kasarelia,

00:23:32.260 --> 00:23:34.000
the enemy is still lurking there!

00:23:34.660 --> 00:23:39.000
The forests of our home are scorched by the explosions of mobile suits.

00:23:39.560 --> 00:23:44.330
But, Üso fears both V2's enormous power...

00:23:44.360 --> 00:23:48.830
...as well as the power within himself, and can no longer fight.

00:23:49.630 --> 00:23:52.730
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:53.160 --> 00:23:54.160
"The Song of the Wings of Light".

